{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35699","headline":"西门行 · 李咸用","name":"西门行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劳禽不择枝，饥虎不畏槛。\n君子当固穷，无爲仲由滥。\n尔奋空拳彼击剑，水纵长澜火飞焰。\n汉高偶试神蛇验，武王龟筮惊人险。\n四龙或跃犹依泉，小狐勿恃冲波胆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}